{"meta":{"id":"installation","category":"it/linux/linux-types/rocky-linux","title":"설치","subtitle":"(Rocky Linux)","summary":"로키 리눅스 설치 방식과 준비물","tags":["리눅스","로키리눅스","rocky linux","설치"],"color":"teal","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-linux-install","updatedAt":"2026-09-05"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-teal-100/70 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-60 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n<div class=\"absolute -bottom-16 -left-16 w-48 h-48 bg-teal-50/80 rounded-full blur-2xl opacity-80 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-teal-100/80\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\n    <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-teal-50 text-teal-700 border border-teal-200/60 tracking-wider\">\n      <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></span>\n      로키 리눅스 1\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide uppercase text-stone-400 font-serif\">Linux Basics</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">\n    설치 <span class=\"text-base sm:text-lg font-normal text-teal-600 font-serif\">(Rocky Linux)</span>\n  </h1>\n\n  <div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-teal-50/60 border border-teal-100/70 rounded-xl p-3\">\n    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-teal-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\">\n      <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n    </svg>\n    <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\">\n      <strong class=\"text-stone-900\">문서 범위:</strong> RHEL 호환 배포판 로키 리눅스의 설치 방식과 준비물\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"py-5 border-b border-stone-100\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div>\n    <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide uppercase\">핵심 포인트</h2>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\">\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">공식 사이트(rockylinux.org)에서 <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">Minimal 또는 DVD ISO</strong>를 받아 설치</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">CentOS의 사실상 후속작으로, 상업용 RHEL과 바이너리 호환을 목표로 함</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">서버 운영이 목적이면 GUI 없는 <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">Minimal Install</strong>로 시작하는 것이 일반적</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"py-5\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div>\n      <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide uppercase\">설치 방식 비교</h2>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-400 font-medium\">4가지 방식</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xs bg-white\">\n    <table class=\"table-fixed-layout text-left text-xs sm:text-sm\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr class=\"bg-stone-50/90 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider\">\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-3 sm:px-4 w-[30%]\">구분 및 방식</th>\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-1 text-center w-[13%]\">난이도</th>\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-3 sm:px-4 w-[37%]\">특징</th>\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-1 text-center w-[20%]\">파일</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100 font-normal text-stone-700\">\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-teal-700 bg-teal-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[권장]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">Minimal Install</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">중</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">GUI 없이 서버 운영에 필요한 최소 구성</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center\">\n            <button data-download-path=\"it/linux/linux-types/rocky-linux/installation\" data-download-name=\"로키 리눅스 Minimal Install 가이드.zip\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[11px] font-semibold text-teal-700 bg-teal-100/70 hover:bg-teal-200/70 px-2 py-1 rounded-lg transition-colors cursor-pointer\">\n              <svg class=\"w-3 h-3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M4 16v1a3 3 0 003 3h10a3 3 0 003-3v-1m-4-4l-4 4m0 0l-4-4m4 4V4\"></path></svg>\n              다운로드\n            </button>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-sky-700 bg-sky-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[데스크톱]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">Workstation</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">하</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">GNOME GUI 포함, 데스크톱용 구성</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center text-stone-300 text-xs\">—</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-emerald-700 bg-emerald-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[서버]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">Server with GUI</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">중</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">서버 도구 + 관리용 GUI 함께 설치</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center text-stone-300 text-xs\">—</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-purple-700 bg-purple-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[가상화]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">클라우드 이미지</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">상</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">VM/클라우드용 사전 빌드 이미지로 즉시 부팅</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center text-stone-300 text-xs\">—</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mt-2 bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200/80 rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-4.5\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2.5\">\n    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-teal-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n      <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"></path>\n    </svg>\n    <h3 class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-900\">설치 후 체크리스트</h3>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 text-stone-600 pl-1\">\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">설치 후 가장 먼저 <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">sudo dnf update</code>로 최신 패키지를 반영합니다.</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">기본적으로 <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">SELinux와 firewalld가 활성화</strong>되어 있으니 서비스 포트를 열 때 함께 확인해야 합니다.</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">EPEL 저장소를 추가하면 <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">dnf install epel-release</code>로 더 많은 패키지를 사용할 수 있습니다.</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mt-5 pt-3 border-t border-stone-100 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-stone-400\">\n  <span>Linux Basics Guide</span>\n  <span>Rocky Linux</span>\n</div>\n","path":"it/linux/linux-types/rocky-linux/installation","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"linux","title":"리눅스","path":"it/linux"},{"id":"linux-types","title":"리눅스 종류","path":"it/linux/linux-types"},{"id":"rocky-linux","title":"로키 리눅스 (Rocky Linux)","path":"it/linux/linux-types/rocky-linux"}],"hasImage":false}